  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You learn the following new ways to use your Sneak Attack:</p><ul><li><strong>Chivy (Cost: 3d6).</strong> The target must make a Wisdom Saving Throw or use its Reaction to move as far from you as it can, taking the safest route.</li><li><strong>Stupefy (Cost: 2d6).</strong> The target must make an Intelligence Saving Throw or have Disadvantage on the next Saving Throw it makes before the end of your next turn.</li></ul>",
